{"ticker":"KEY","updated":"2026-11-14T01:09:34Z","profile":{"longName":"KeyCorp","shortName":"KeyCorp","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","country":"United States","website":"https://www.key.com","fullTimeEmployees":17562,"marketCap":22661324800,"trailingPE":11.791208,"forwardPE":9.866348,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.991594,"pegRatio":1.39,"targetMeanPrice":25.13,"targetHighPrice":43.0,"targetLowPrice":22.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.115,"earningsGrowth":0.244,"grossMargins":0.0,"operatingMargins":0.35525,"profitMargins":0.27987,"totalRevenue":7575000064,"beta":1.068,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":24.07,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":16.91,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.84},"summary":"KeyCorp operates as the holding company for KeyBank National Association that provides various retail and commercial banking products and services in the United States. It operates in two segments, Consumer Bank and Commercial Bank. The company offers various deposits and investment products; personal finance and financial wellness, lending, student loan refinancing, mortgage and home equity, credit card, treasury, and business advisory; commercial leasing, investment management, consumer finance; and wealth management and investment services for institutional, non-profit, and high-net-worth clients. It also provides lending, cash management, equipment financing, and commercial mortgage loans; and capital market products and services, such as syndicated finance, debt and equity underwriting, fixed income and equity sales and trading, derivatives, foreign exchange, mergers and acquisition, other advisory services, and public finance to large corporate and institutional clients. In addition, the company offers personal and institutional trust custody services, personal financial and planning services, access to mutual funds, treasury services, and international banking services. Further, it provides community development financing, securities underwriting, brokerage, and investment banking services, as well as merchant services. The company was founded in 1849 and is headquartere","summary_zh":"KeyCorp 作為 KeyBank National Association 的控股公司運營，在美國提供各種零售和商業銀行產品和服務。它分為兩個部門：消費者銀行部門和商業銀行部門。本公司提供各種存款和投資產品；個人理財和財務健康、貸款、學生貸款再融資、抵押貸款和房屋淨值、信用卡、財務和商業諮詢；商業租賃、投資管理、消費金融；為機構、非營利和高淨值客戶提供財富管理和投資服務。它還提供貸款、現金管理、設備融資和商業抵押貸款；資本市場產品和服務，例如銀團融資、債務和股票承銷、固定收益和股票銷售和交易、衍生性商品、外匯、併購、其他諮詢服務以及向大型企業和機構客戶提供的公共融資。此外，該公司還提供個人和機構信託託管服務、個人財務和規劃服務、共同基金、財務服務和國際銀行服務。此外，它還提供社區發展融資、證券承銷、經紀和投資銀行服務以及商業服務。公司成立於1849年，總部位於","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"銀行 - 區域","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":19.13,"h":19.15,"l":18.77,"c":18.84,"v":32455100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":18.86,"h":18.87,"l":18.4,"c":18.63,"v":34792400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":18.67,"h":19.02,"l":18.48,"c":18.71,"v":29317400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":18.79,"h":19.15,"l":18.62,"c":19.13,"v":32893500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":19.16,"h":19.2,"l":18.97,"c":19.08,"v":43884200},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":18.92,"h":19.04,"l":18.64,"c":18.72,"v":16940400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":18.81,"h":19.08,"l":18.7,"c":18.74,"v":22698500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":18.8,"h":18.96,"l":18.57,"c":18.77,"v":26364000},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":18.66,"h":18.9,"l":18.54,"c":18.81,"v":25725400},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":18.88,"h":19.09,"l":18.8,"c":18.89,"v":21600100},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":18.95,"h":19.08,"l":18.63,"c":18.88,"v":27699000},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":18.94,"h":19.0,"l":18.3,"c":18.69,"v":30421800},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":18.63,"h":18.68,"l":18.37,"c":18.51,"v":25284900},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":18.49,"h":18.56,"l":18.28,"c":18.45,"v":19987100},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":18.61,"h":18.77,"l":18.5,"c":18.63,"v":21806700},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":18.75,"h":19.04,"l":18.35,"c":18.54,"v":29963300},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":18.61,"h":18.69,"l":18.39,"c":18.41,"v":29621900},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":18.5,"h":18.5,"l":18.04,"c":18.09,"v":26505700},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":18.16,"h":18.29,"l":18.01,"c":18.18,"v":32344600